# An X session on Dolly's display: the Xsdl server, twm managing the
# windows, and three of X's own clients in theirs: a clock, eyes that follow
# the pointer and a terminal with a shell, where imgui-x11 starts Dear ImGui's
# example in a window of its own.
FROM /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-system 0e1e68a8bf1207ae829c338fb9794d94e7747294e22161eec79a8183a526c9ba
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xorg-server 64eba5145ff767bef3deea9df3a8c48f322ab4e4455a3e63923ba06fd6b89556
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-twm d141dac67d2937541118bda7ee1e46a9054e3dfca8f15e5032cdec16cb8fa442
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xclock f43ddc6d4ead08480595df32d6028172b1f764951a787d910fef63e7c0500d82
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xeyes b9d4ed632740827815d15fc2d6c08c1cd2f362dddf8026bbeb5cf2d17d5016bf
